abstract: "AIBIS (Tier 2B of the BizOn ecosystem) scores six international market-entry modes (export, licensing, joint venture, strategic alliance, wholly-owned FDI, digital entry) for a firm and a host country on eight priority dimensions with published weights. The engine is deterministic, so learners can trace the reasoning behind a ranking. A literature base links each mode and parameter to verified sources. Preview release: parameters are illustrative and the model is not yet calibrated. Split out of the BizOn ecosystem (https://github.com/thuyhuongctu/BizOn) for academic archiving and a Zenodo DOI."
